{"4063950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Linkies", "steam_appid": 4063950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together</strong>  <br>The bond mechanic in Linkies is a fresh twist on co-op platformers. It’s not a racing game, but a true test of your relationship with your friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/24ac2ef7897cf85d6b06879b35deee64.poster.avif?t=1778244300\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/24ac2ef7897cf85d6b06879b35deee64.webm?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/24ac2ef7897cf85d6b06879b35deee64.mp4?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Parkour Levels</strong> <br>Embark on a journey to the edge of outer space with every jump! Don’t be fooled by the game’s simple controls; you must work in harmony with your Linky. Panic, and you risk falling!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d706065d1d29b904743c9442782a1b6e.poster.avif?t=1778244300\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d706065d1d29b904743c9442782a1b6e.webm?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d706065d1d29b904743c9442782a1b6e.mp4?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make new friends in Linkies, chat with them, and enjoy the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/32164f7f18ce7324ef4471e246c6f649.poster.avif?t=1778244300\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/32164f7f18ce7324ef4471e246c6f649.webm?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/32164f7f18ce7324ef4471e246c6f649.mp4?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t Underestimate Linkies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linkies can turn even massive planets into dust with lasers they shoot from their heads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d0ab2c909ce0019d4f47445df1513f63.poster.avif?t=1778244300\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d0ab2c909ce0019d4f47445df1513f63.webm?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d0ab2c909ce0019d4f47445df1513f63.mp4?t=1778244300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Course is a Different Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of space through challenging parkour courses and travel to unexplored lands!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together</strong>  <br>The bond mechanic in Linkies is a fresh twist on co-op platformers. It’s not a racing game, but a true test of your relationship with your friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid